### ====================================================================
### AIRLINE RESERVATION SYSTEM — LIVE INTERVIEW DEMO (REST CLIENT)
### ====================================================================

### 1. Gateway Aggregate Health Check
GET http://localhost:3004/api/v1/health/aggregate

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Search All Flights (Notice totalSeats on Flight ID 1)
GET http://localhost:3004/api/v1/flights/flight

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Inspect Flight UK-811 (ID: 1) Before Booking
GET http://localhost:3004/api/v1/flights/flight/1

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Register a New User Account (Generates OTP)
# @name signup
POST http://localhost:3004/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Live Interviewer",
  "email": "candidate_demo@airline.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Verify User Email with OTP
### (The OTP is extracted automatically from the signup response above)
POST http://localhost:3004/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidate_demo@airline.com",
  "otp": "{{signup.response.body.data.otp}}"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Sign In and Receive JWT Bearer Token
# @name signin
POST http://localhost:3004/api/v1/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "candidate_demo@airline.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Create a Booking (2 Seats on Flight 1)
### Notice: Bearer token is automatically injected from Step 6!
# @name booking
POST http://localhost:3004/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.data}}

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "noOfSeats": 2
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Inspect Flight UK-811 Again (Verify Seats Decremented by 2!)
GET http://localhost:3004/api/v1/flights/flight/1

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. View Authenticated User's Bookings
GET http://localhost:3004/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.data}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Cancel Booking (Restores Seats back to original count)
PATCH http://localhost:3004/api/v1/bookings/{{booking.response.body.data.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.data}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Inspect Flight UK-811 Final Time (Verify Seats Restored!)
GET http://localhost:3004/api/v1/flights/flight/1
